      "spam": false,
      "value": "Sounds like that's more of a Mecanim problem than VRChat. Mecanim is notoriously bad about completely taking over things and preventing other systems from using them. Since your animation is controlling the blendshape weight, Mecanim will force it to 0 whenever the animation is not in use and prevent VRChat's blinking script from changing it.\n\nBest advice is to duplicate the blendshape in Blender and use the duplicated one instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
