  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you use custom animation - Animation component added to avatar GameObject, like custom blinking that use shape keys, and then you also add animation override (like to EMOTE1) that use this same shape key as that other animation - it will stop working.\nThis should be fixed, as it does not make sense to disable avatar animation just because some other animation also use this same shape key.",
